OL,3,GNEWSAJersey's summer officially warmest
OL,4,Aon record
OL,5,
OL,6,FThis summer was the warmest since
OL,7,Frecords began in 1894, the Jersey Met
OL,8,FOffice has confirmed.
OL,10,FIt said the average temperature for
OL,11,FJune, July and August was 20.5C
OL,12,F(68.9F), compared to a 30-year average
OL,13,Fof 17.7C (63.9F) for these months.
OL,15,FThe hottest single day was 25 June
OL,16,Fduring which 39.3C (102.7F) was
OL,17,Frecorded.
OL,23,APub: 03-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
