OL,3,GNEWSAJersey's summer officially warmest
OL,4,Aon record
OL,5,
OL,6,FRegional meteorologists said the data
OL,7,Fwas in line with evidence that climate
OL,8,Fchange was driving hotter summers and
OL,9,Fincreasing the likelihood of drier
OL,10,Fconditions.
